      <h1>Hair Transplant Clinic Meta + Google Ads in Navi Mumbai 2026 &mdash; Complete FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on meta + google performance ads for clinics for hair transplant + fue + fut clinics in Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code + surgical facility norms), local landmarks (Vashi + Nerul + Belapur + Kharghar + Kamothe), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
